OL,3,AUK set to turn cooler as unsettled
OL,4,Aweather continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuch of the UK is set to feel cooler
OL,7,Ffrom Tuesday, as more changeable
OL,8,Fweather moves in.
OL,10,FParts of the UK are also likely to see
OL,11,Fsome spells of rain, especially to
OL,12,Fnorthern and western parts of the UK.
OL,14,FThe rest of the week stays a little
OL,15,Funsettled with further spells of rain.
OL,17,FIt could turn more settled into next
OL,18,Fweek with temperatures rising above
OL,19,Faverage for some, though heatwave
OL,20,Fconditions are looking increasingly
OL,21,Funlikely.
